// Ch11 B07 "Twice" (C, 1 min). T03: the core's bound light goes still, then goes UP: a small lift of motes
// rising in slow spirals through the collapsed vault bay, turning glimmer_lift gold (rule 3: what is
// released rises); the 3 s warm grade lift. T04: the party watching; this time somebody says it. Liss looks
// at the dead frame with her jaw tight: every lamp in her own gear is the same kind of light (unspoken).
title: ch11_twice
location: ch11/lowlight
---
@letterbox on
@camera T03
@vfx glimmer_lift at=engine_core count=16 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 5.0
@camera T04
<<if $ch10_drowner_felled>>
    Ysolde [neutral]: That is twice. #line:ch11_twice_001
<<endif>>
Asha [sad]: They were waiting. Inside it. All this time. #line:ch11_twice_002
@anim liss look_at lamp_engine
@wait 3.0
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
